window.products.push({"id":798060,"name":"DinoMars Electric Automatic Drink Dispenser - Beverage Dispenser for Fridge Gallon with Bottle Opening Date Recorder - One Handed Tap for Kids and Par","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61S-1dOTsJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👋[ ONE-HAND USE ] - Bringing the drink gallon out of the refrigerator every time you want a cold drink and pouring it is inconvenient, especially for kids, the elderly, pregnant women, or people with disabilities. Simply pull the sealing cover down and gently press your cup, glass, or bowl against it. Beverage flows vertically until you pull your cup, glass, or bowl away and release the lever. 🥛[ NO NEED TO LIFT, NO DRIPS, NO SPILLS ] - The leakproof deisgn with the micro switch sealing cover prevents accidental spills, drips or mess in the fridge. 📅[ BOTTLE OPENING DATE RECORDER ] - You can record the opening date of the beverage by rotating the dial so that you don't consume expired milk or old beverages. 🔋[ RELIABLE BATTERY ] - The low temperatures in the fridge can cause normal batteries to discharge quickly, but our drink dispenser is powered by a built-in rechargeable battery that lasts up to a full month of constant use. The pump can be recharged using the included USB cable. 🧴[ UNIVERSAL CAP ] - The silicone rings make the automatic beverage dispenser suitable for most bottles with a mouth diameter ranging from 1\" to 1.5\". 🧼[ EASY TO CLEAN ] - The silicon tube is detachable, so cleaning is not a hassle. Just put it under a tap water jet without any extra cleaning tools needed. The pump is located on the top of the bottle and not submerged in liquid which prevents it from getting stuck. 🎁[ GREAT GIFT IDEA ] Your friends are throwing a party? Don't worry! DinoMars Automatic Drink Dispenser makes it the ideal gift! 🎀[100% MONEY BACK GUARANTEE] - We made sure that our electric beverage dispenser meets the highest standard of quality but if for ANY reason you are not satisfied, you will receive a refund. Click on the \"Add to Cart\" button NOW and get this amazing new product! 👍[ USEFUL TIPS ] - Gently press the lid when using the dispenser to avoid the lid getting stuck in the open position. Close the sealing cover after use to cut off the air from the milk and seal it against accidental contact. For cleaning the pump, it is recommended to detach it from the bottle, place the silicon tube in a glass of water and use it until the water coming out of the pump is clean.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61S-1dOTsJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DINOMARS","source_asin":"B0B3WC6RWT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-798060","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3WC6RWT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3WC6RWT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
