window.products.push({"id":798197,"name":"Set of 5 Wooden Ukrainian Pysanky Easter Egg Key Chains","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71f4pnBR3cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Fill your Easter basket with these colorful geometric design wooden Easter eggs. Hand carved and hand painted by skilled artists high in the Carpathian mountains, Western Ukraine. Historically, one of the most popular Easter gifts was hand painted real eggshell or wooden egg. Family members or friends gave them to each other, and a bowl of Easter eggs would also be set out in the house, to protect against misfortunes. Become part of the ancient tradition by sharing these colorful Easter gifts with your friends and family!  1.5 Inches Tall X 1.1 Inches in Diameter (Approx. Dimensions) Pine Wood Hand Carved Hand Painted  High-gloss Varnish Applied  Made in Ukraine Key chain nesting doll shapes are a charming and unique way to keep your keys organized. These wooden dolls are hand-painted and connect together to form a single key ring. They make a great gift for friends and family, and they are also a fun way to accessorize your own key ring. Whether you choose a traditional design or a more modern style, key chains in the shape of nesting dolls are a fun and practical way to keep your keys organized.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71f4pnBR3cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BestPysanky","source_asin":"B07H781Z66","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-798197","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07H781Z66","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07H781Z66","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
