window.products.push({"id":798251,"name":"Small Tower Fan, 13 inch Electric Oscillating Desk Fan, 2 Settings, Equipped with Turbine Technology, Compact, Personal Rotating Standing Fan for Offi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Izj0VbMaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description: Small yet Effective - This Tower Fan is all You Need for Your Workstation or Home Don't you have a huge space to install those conventional fans? Yet you want efficient cooling? Well, this tower fan is here to your rescue. This fan is not only a small size fan size, but it is also engineered with a high-tech turbine mechanism, ensuring incredible cooling with a strong thrust of air. And the cherry on top is its portability and noiseless operation. You can carry it around in a hassle-free manner, where it will never deviate your concentration, neither will it bother your sleep. Noiseless: Whenever you buy a fan, the first thing that strikes our mind is the annoying noise that they make. But the advanced technology of this desk fan assures quiet operation. So, it will never disturb your concentration to work, study, or a night of sound sleep. Oscillation: This electric fan is equipped with 60-degree oscillation. Therefore, the airflow remains equal. Handy: The 13 inches height and 7.8 inches width of this fan makes it a significant space savior. You can keep it anywhere. It is easy to carry around as well. Package: The package includes one tower fan and a user manual. Here are some additional details of this tower fan: ●It is an electric fan. ●Its power consumption is 120V. ●It works with one knob only. Use it to turn on/off the fan, or to change its speed. NOTE: ●The fan’s oscillation should not be blocked, else that might damage its functioning. ●When you are not using the fan for long, keep it at a safe and dry place. It is highly recommended to use the original packaging box of this fan to protect the product from dust. If you have any concerns regarding the fan's functioning, its oscillation, or any defects, feel free to contact the seller.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Izj0VbMaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BE1","source_asin":"B0837DNFTZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-798251","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0837DNFTZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0837DNFTZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
