window.products.push({"id":798272,"name":"Platinum Silicone Reusable Drinking Straws for Kids and Adults, Mason Jars and Other Glasses and Cups (8 Medium Straws + Cleaning Brush)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51HLtJX2BhL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"Pint jars are ideal for almost any kind of drink! Keep your family safe from chemical leach and serve your refreshments or mixed drinks in style! The most reliable way to clean reusable straws is our straw cleaner with soap and hot water. They are also dishwasher safe, or a quick rinse might be sufficient. You can also boil these to disinfect them if you want to. My personal cleaning routine is to rinse them after use, put them in the dishwasher, then run a straw cleaner through them and rinse again before putting them away. My dishwasher usually gets them clean but sometimes leaves a little residue so this ensures they are clean. Jars and lids are sold separately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51HLtJX2BhL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mason Jar Lifestyle","source_asin":"B018KQOYQQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-798272","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B018KQOYQQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B018KQOYQQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":798273,"name":"The Happy Hootie Foil and Plastic Wrap Dispenser for Kitchen Organization and Storage. Great for Kitchen Organization and Storage. Compatible with 12 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nc5MuhuIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HINGED WRAP DISPENSER HOLDER - The hinged design makes it easy to load and unload new rolls of product, no more trying to place the rolls in the box and ruin your paper! With the hinged design simply open the box, place your rolls in, close and latch the box and use the large openings to feed the paper through! With the additional mounting plate and hardware the plastic wrap dispenser with cutter can easily be hung or if you don't want to hang it is a great drawer organizer! The 3 slot foil organizer comes with silicone grip pads KITCHEN SPACE SAVINGS - Custom sized to fit the standard 12 inch sized aluminum foil, saran wrap, wax paper, and parchment paper. No more messy broken cardboard boxes! Organize your different wrap rolls in an more convenient manner, make your drawer neat and organized with this bamboo box! Or if you don't have room in a drawer mount it in a cabinet or on a wall for extra kitchen organization and storage. The aluminum foil dispenser is designed specifically for your different wraps organization. 21 LABEL STICKERS INCLUDED - Identify drawer contents instantly with the labels on the box. You can label the bamboo organizer clearly, or choose not use the labels to keep the clean look of the wraps holder. The labels included are for foil, plastic, wax, and parchment. BUILT IN SLIDE CUTTERS - The cutters are made to cut 12 inch sized papers and will cut your paper every time! Just pull out the wrap from the dispenser and then slide the knob on your dispenser to cut it. The hinged design, paired with the custom sized holes, which are larger than most competitors, allow for easy access to the rolls. STURDY MATERIALS - Made of natural bamboo wood and metal hinges are built to last. Bamboo is not only gentler than plastic but also easier to clean and maintain than hardwood— it can be cleaned quickly with warm water. Simply wipe the aluminum foil holder down with a damp cloth (Do not soak in water)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nc5MuhuIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Happy Hootie","source_asin":"B09ZPRSCMX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-798273","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZPRSCMX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZPRSCMX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
