window.products.push({"id":798330,"name":"Cool Mist Humidifiers for Bedroom, Ultrasonic Air Humidifiers for Large Room Baby Home, 4.5L Top Fill Personal Humidifier with Adjustable Mist Mode, L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aJUR6CYhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Long-lasting Humidifier & Auto Shut-Off】Design with a large capacity water tank of 4.5L, the humidifier can work up for 15 to 30 hours of continuous use. You can enjoy whole night sleep, frees you from refilling water frequently. It features an automatic shut-off safety that will turn off when when it runs out of water, preventing damage to the unit and ensure your safety. 【Ultrasonic Cool Mist Humidifier】Safely moisturizes the dry air in your room letting you breathe easy and get more restful sleep, moisturize your skin and alleviate the discomfort. The 360° swivel adjustable nozzle allows mist to be dispersed in any direction, hence allowing you to control the distribution of moisture in the room. 【Easy to Refill & Clean】The bedroom humidifier with top fill design has a flat surface and lareg opening that allows you to refill or clean the tank very effectively.【Built-in Essential Oil Tray】Allow you to enjoy the mist and fragrance at the same time. Please drop essential oil on the sponge ring inside the aromatherapy box that is under the nozzle. Do NOT add it into water tank or base chamber. 【Deep Sleep Mode - Ultra Quiet】The air humidifier works almost no noise which offers maximum relaxation during sleeping or study without any nasty noise. Turn off the nightlight by pressing the touch panel for 3s. Enjoy all night mist and rest easily. Perfect for your baby and a disturbance-free sleep at night. 【Adjustable Mist Levels Options】With 3 adjustable mist levels, the baby humidifier makes humidify much more precise and effortless to adjust mist output what you want. Just one touch, you can set a customized level according to fit your comfort level and deliver mist to every corner of the room. Provide Ideal coverage for bedroom, living room, nursery, office and so on.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aJUR6CYhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mikikin","source_asin":"B0BRXY5WCM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-798330","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRXY5WCM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRXY5WCM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
