window.products.push({"id":798551,"name":"Marinex Bakeware Small Glass Souffle Dish, 6\" x 2-3/8\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616DqLodtSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Marinex Glass Bakeware production began over 50 years ago by Santa Marina, the largest glass manufacturer in Latin America. Located in Brazil, Santa Marina has been producing different glass products since 1895. The factory location is close to raw material deposits of boron and sand which is rich in color and quality. During the production process, these raw materials are combined using heat to make borosilicate glass. Borosilicate glass is resistant to changes in temperatures used in cooking and baking. The raw materials also give Marinex glass bakeware a slight bluish tint consistant throughout all pieces. Marinex Glass Bakeware offers several shapes and sizes that have countless uses in culinary activities and are prominent by their beauty, durability, and ease of cleaning. It can be used to prepare, bake, and serve food as well as to freeze prepared food. It is safe for both conventional ovens and microwave ovens. Marinex Bakeware can go from the freezer/refrigerator to a pre-heated oven where the oven temperature does not exceed 100C or 212F to start. However, Marinex Bakeware should not be used on stovetop burners or over a direct flame. This is a 23.7oz. small round souffle dish that measures 6\" x 2-3/8\" . All Marinex bakeware is dishwasher safe. Item #GD16384411","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616DqLodtSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Marinex","source_asin":"B0016MZSGW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-798551","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0016MZSGW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0016MZSGW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":798552,"name":"Yoocaa 2 in 1 Hat Organizer for Baseball Caps, Hat Racks with 24 Holder Clips for All Caps & Beanie, Hat Storage Rack Suitable for Standard Size Hange","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UInYCAdHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🧢【2 in 1 Hat Organizer】Each item comes with 2 pack hat organizers, 1 hanging rope, and 1 wooden stick set (hangers not included). With them, you can easily assemble a double-layer hat organizer. They are durable and all accessories are made of high-quality materials. They are also easy to fold and carry, and you can also use them to dry and store clothes when traveling. 🧢【Better Support & Balance】Yoocaa 2 in 1 cap organizer will be more upright and better balanced with the support of wooden sticks and connecting cords. Only 1 hanger space is needed to store 24 different hats at the same time, such as baseball caps, fitted hats, trucker hats, husband hats, or other hats. 🧢【Hold Hats Securely】A total of 24 clips is made of high-quality stainless steel, not easily rust or corrosion. Each clip is tested, has perfect tension, and can grip the hats very firmly. The clip edge is smooth, and will not leave marks on your hat, you do not have to worry about your hat getting ruined. 🧢【Multi-Functional Organizer】A simple but functional design can keep your essentials neat and dust-free. All you need is a standard-size metal, plastic, or wooden hanger to easily organize caps, ties, belts, headbands, scarves, gloves, socks, and bras in your closet. 🧢【Save Space & Easily Access】You can also use the hanging rope to hang it behind the door or in the entryway, which can be used to store headbands, hair accessories, and hats. With this hat rack, you can say goodbye to clutter and never see miscellaneous items that seem to pile up again. And you can quickly see and easily access each hat before going out.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UInYCAdHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yoocaa","source_asin":"B0BRSSFNRJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-798552","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRSSFNRJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRSSFNRJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
