window.products.push({"id":798627,"name":"Songsongjia Blackout Curtain for Bedroom-Grommet Thermal Insulated Solid Grommet Top Blackout Drapes,Set of 2 Panels(52x95 Inch,Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fGc-XEJSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Blackout Curtain: Triple Weave Fabric Block out sunlight and UV rays. No chemical coating, no pungent smell. Soundproof and energy efficient. Privacy protected. The new fabric is more environmentally friendly and healthy, which can be used for many years and is convenient for care. It can be washed by hand or machine, but it cannot be bleached. Super heavy and soft fabric adopt the triple weave technology balancing room temperature by insulating against summer HEAT and winter CHILL Energy efficient design reduces energy Each curtain panel has 8 silver metal grommets on top. Each grommet inner diameter is 1.6 inch, comparable with most rods. Easy to hang, and slide smoothly. 2 panels per package Songsongjia story My husband and I have known each other for more than 8 years. We have a very good relationship. When we were ready to get married and move into our apartment, we faced the problem of decorating our new house. At that time, we were like most people. There are many choices, styles, sizes, colors, etc.  But then we were deeply fascinated by curtains, because they have a strong decorative effect, different curtain colors will make the home style different, and can make the home more warm So we want to share our experience with more people, so that more people can choose curtains suitable for home decoration, and find a lover who can spend the rest of our life together We decided to open an online shop first. Although our processing of pictures is not gorgeous enough, and the description and expression of products are not detailed enough, what we can guarantee is that every curtain is sewn by our own hand, we carefully I chose the original fabric of the curtains, and then carefully hand-cutting, sewing, packaging, every step of the link is carefully adjusted, I hope that consumers can buy satisfactory Songsongjia products, and we also humbly accept your suggestions","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fGc-XEJSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Songsongjia","source_asin":"B08KSCCY2L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-798627","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KSCCY2L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KSCCY2L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
