window.products.push({"id":798711,"name":"Indian Sandalwood Incense Stick - (80 Sticks) Charcoal Free Incense Made from Upcycled Flowers | All Natural Incense Non Toxic | Meditation Stress Rel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811eJx1NT3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BURN CLEAN CHARCOAL-FREE INCENSE : Charcoal produces toxic gases like sulphur oxides, xylene when burnt. This pack of 80 sticks of incense sandalwood uses flower powder instead of Charcoal. MADE FROM SACRED FLOWERS : Over 800 mil tonne of flower is offered to Gods in India every year, which is then directly disposed in rivers. We UPCYCLE these holy flowers to use in our incense sticks. WHY USE TOXIC CHEMICAL INCENSE? : Calmveda Incense uses only IFRA compliant fragrances to create a truly beneficial and relaxing experience for you. Daily Meditation Incense - Our sandalwood incense is used in Buddhist monasteries for meditation and prayer. The woody scent of rare and precious sandalwood has calming effects on the mind and promotes relaxation LOOKING FOR THOUGHTFUL GIFT ? : Each of us wants love, care & comfort for our loved ones. These handmade natural incense are perfect way to convey these feelings. HANDMADE BY INDIAN ARTISANS : Raw incense is sourced directly from rural women self help groups in India. This way we economically empower this community while providing you authentic products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811eJx1NT3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Calmveda","source_asin":"B09B2PV9LH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-798711","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B2PV9LH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B2PV9LH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
