window.products.push({"id":798735,"name":"LSCUKOO Clearance Coffee Table Set, Stacking End Side Table with Modern Design (Solid Wood, Set of 3)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zi8u8flmL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"This stylish nesting table set is made of high end solid wood which is sturdy enough for daily use. With simple modern design, they can perfectly match any style of your living room. Can be used as a coffee table or end table whether in home or office. Smooth table top that can be cleaned easily with a duster or cloth. What's more, round design desktop can prevent any unexpected bruising. Easy to assemble by following the product installation. Product Size: Small: 12.6 x 12.6 x 12.6 inch; Medium: 15.75 x 15.75 x 15.75 inch; Large: 19.7 x 19.7 x 19.7 inch.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zi8u8flmL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LSCUKOO","source_asin":"B071D2JHQ7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-798735","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071D2JHQ7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071D2JHQ7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":798736,"name":"Embossed Foil Party Decor Garland, 40th","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31KSMZBZcSL._AC_.jpg","description":"From the Manufacturer With over 80 years of combined experience in the paper and party goods industry, Creative Converting has successfully established itself as a highly respected designer, manufacturer and distributor of disposable tableware, including paper napkins, plates, cups, table covers and plastic cutlery in a variety of solid colors as well as ensemble designs for everyday entertaining, occasions and holidays. A complete offering of décor and accessory items also includes paper lanterns, confetti, cello bags, centerpieces, streamers, candles, gift bags and more. Committed to service, quality, design and innovation, Creative Converting can more than accommodate all your party and event needs. During the Depression in 1932, Elmer Krueger, an Indianapolis industrial engineer, took an idea, $250 of borrowed capital and founded Paper Art Company in his basement. On May 28, 1935, the Dionne quintuplets celebrated their first birthday at a table set with Paper Art products. Paper Art soon became “a complete party supplier”, adding holiday decorations, party favors, centerpieces, masks and hats, plastic cups and flatware. Converting, Inc. enters the party goods market with special occasion tissue and plastic table covers. Over the years, acquisitions of quality companies and a merger in 2007 between Creative Expressions and Converting, Inc. partnered to form Creative Converting. We remain so under our parent company, Hoffmaster Group, Inc., the leader in quality paper party goods in the USA. Bring us to your party.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31KSMZBZcSL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Creative Converting","source_asin":"B004W9KC9E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-798736","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004W9KC9E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004W9KC9E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":798737,"name":"Fiesta 3-pc. Classic Dinnerware Set Lapis","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51th42LhZlL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"A new hand-me-down! But not too shabby … at least with the Lapis 3-Piece Classic Place Setting by Fiesta, a collection of elegant essentials for the dining table, your kids or grandkids have something that can be shared and passed on, time and again. Inside and out, each piece is vitrified with classic detailing full of character and Fiesta culture. Over the rich, shiny surface of the bowl and plates is a calming lapis blue finish, too – just the pleasant color to grow warm, positive vibes into the style of your kitchen décor. Even if you choose to use the place setting for breakfast or dinner, or for simply warming up leftovers, the pieces are easy to simply stick in the oven or microwave for a quick bite and then the dishwasher for easy cleaning. So many colors, so many uses – the Fiesta Lapis 3-Piece Classic Place Setting is just the colorfully vibrant setting for fun family reunions, bright celebrations, or just simple get-togethers. Family tradition is something that can begin anytime, so why not now?","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51th42LhZlL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fiesta","source_asin":"B07C4ZTWPJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-798737","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07C4ZTWPJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07C4ZTWPJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":798738,"name":"Abbyson Living Crimson Italian Leather Armchair, Burgundy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kH+Wq-3zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Because this armchair is structurally framed with kiln-dried hardwoods and filled with high-density plush foam cushioning, you have no need to sacrifice style and elegance for durability or classic comfort. The seat cushions are designed to stay in position, and the back cushions are conveniently detachable via sturdy hook-and-loop fasteners. The rich leather on the seating area is matched on the back and sides of the piece.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kH+Wq-3zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Abbyson®","source_asin":"B00AELOYWA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-798738","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00AELOYWA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00AELOYWA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":798739,"name":"Smart Design 84042-LC Cadiz Contemporary Metal Steel Battery Powered Lantern, 14-Inch, Weathered Brown Finish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jpXlxrq8L._AC_SL1008_.jpg","description":"The Cadiz Candle Lantern is a beautiful, Moroccan-inspired lantern that adds character, elegance and warm light to your home. Standing 14 inches tall, the Cadiz Candle Lantern has a weathered brown finish and is illuminated with an amber LED candle. Lantern features an on/off switch with a six hour timer. Simply activate timer mode at the desired time and the lantern will stay on for six hours, turn off for 18, and then illuminate again at the same time every day. The lantern has a metal handle for hanging or makes a great table top piece. Easy to use indoors or outside. Requires 2xC batteries (not included)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jpXlxrq8L._AC_SL1008_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Smart Design","source_asin":"B01DQLZ9QY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-798739","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01DQLZ9QY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01DQLZ9QY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
