window.products.push({"id":798746,"name":"Honey Candles Ornamentals-Fluted Sphere-Violet, 1 EA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pDOFBXLTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Honey Candles are inspired by the natural beauty around us. 100Percent pure natural beeswax Honey Candles are hand-made at our environmentally friendly shop in Southern British Columbia Canada, an area known for its pristine beauty. Our candles are made using sustainable business practices and manufacturing techniques. Honey candle's Social and environmental initiatives include save our Bees to support research for healthy Bees, life candles for families in need around the world, natural packaging, charitable and community donations as well as many sustainable business practices and staff lifestyle choices. Unlike soy, palm and paraffin wax, natural beeswax is used essentially in its native state. There is no bleaching or hydrogenating. Beeswax does not go rancid, has a very long shelf life and won't melt or distort. Beeswax production does not require the sole use of large areas of agricultural land, instead it supports Crop Pollination for a healthy food supply around the world. Honey Candles do not have artificial additives to prevent fading. If this is a concern minimize direct sunlight and full spectrum Ultraviolet lights. 100Percent natural beeswax candles have long been known for their air purifying effects and can greatly reduce odors in your home. By burning 100Percent pure beeswax candles you can transform the unpleasant odors in any room without the use of chemicals. Studies have shown that burning beeswax stimulates the pituitary gland, increasing intuition, creativity and heightening dream activity. Some say burning a 100Percent pure beeswax candle before bed helps them achieve a more restful sleep. Our candles burn up to three times longer than paraffin. Many other candle waxes have different degrees of toxic additives to produce longer burn times. Soy wax candles can be long burning by using additives or by providing only a small white flame.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pDOFBXLTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Honey Candles","source_asin":"B079KL19NF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-798746","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079KL19NF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079KL19NF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":798747,"name":"TZUTOGETHER Rustic Console Sofa Table, 55'' Rustic 3-Tier Open Bookshelf&TV Stand, Industrial Wood and Metal Sofa Table for Long Hallway/Entryway Foye","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81N229LuSnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👍【Large Storage Space】A total of three levels of partitions, provide you with sufficient space, you can put your favorite books, photos, crafts and other items on it. The simple industrial design makes it a console sofa table suitable for anywhere – Entry table for hallway, couch table for living room & bedroom, industrial bookcase for home & office. Also perfect place to set down keys, vases, home decorations or even works as a TV stand. 👍【Stability】With double X-frame on the back ensure this sofa table a super strong stability. At the same time, there are iron tubes under each board to support it to ensure that it will not shake during use. 👍【Dimensions】Dimensions: 55.2”W x 13.8”D x 30”H(140*35*76 cm). Height between shelves: 11.1-11.3- inch without the thickness of the shelf. The oak finish creates an elevated look for decor while blending flawlessly with modern styles, and the same time add charm to your entryway, living room, bedroom or hallway. 👍【Material & Structure Features】This sofa table crafted from durable premium MDF board and quality steel frame, it can hold 300 lbs stuff each layer and provide an adequate storage space. The adjustable feet with EVA anti-scratch feet to prevent wobbling from uneven floor, also protecting the floor from scratches. 👍【Install and after-sales service】This product comes with an installation manual and installation tools along with the package. With the exquisite design and all clear instructions, you can easily complete the assembly within 30 minutes. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81N229LuSnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TZUTOGETHER","source_asin":"B08SMFV8X8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-798747","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SMFV8X8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SMFV8X8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
