window.products.push({"id":798754,"name":"HAWAIIAN BIRD OF PARADISE QUILTED PILLOW CASE COVER P10-16\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7175MwhoV6L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"A beautiful quilt pattern in a colorful pattern and Bird of Paradise flowers in green, yellow and blue .* The bird-of-paradise is known for producing an incredibly distinct flower, which likens the shape and colors of tropical birds. The back side is a solid off white with no design and green edging. MEASURES 16\" ON ALL SIDES. FITS 16\" PILLOW.* Zippered Closure * 65% Polyester and 35% Cotton Designed by Regency Marketing on Oahu and hand quilted in the Philippines . * Hand wash in cold water & line dry. Quilting was first introduced to Hawaii in the early 1800's by the wives of American missionaries. The art form was quickly adapted by the Hawaiian women who have since created their own quilting style, inspired by their heritage and their fondness of nature. We are happy to offer you this special style of Hawaiian quilting hand-stitched with loving care.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7175MwhoV6L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"East of Maui Hawaiian Store","source_asin":"B004AA09RU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-798754","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004AA09RU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004AA09RU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
