window.products.push({"id":798813,"name":"Silicone Brown Monkey Reusable Training Chopsticks for Beginners, 9 Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51oyFSfEa+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Fun and easy to use! These cute silicone training chopsticks are the perfect learning tool if you want to learn how to properly use chopsticks Comes with silicone finger placement holders to show you the right spot and the right grip. Comfortable silicone finger rings and nonslip grip. Suitable for both right and left handed people The cute monkey design will help your child stay focused and excited to learn Eco-friendly! No need to keep buying wooden chopsticks when you can reuse these chopsticks for a long time Quality material. BPA free and high quality silicone material. Hand wash only. NOT Intended for children under the age of three.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51oyFSfEa+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Needzo","source_asin":"B08FRNGPH8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-798813","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FRNGPH8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FRNGPH8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":798814,"name":"Freshware Silicone Mold, Soap Mold for Cupcake, Muffin, Pudding, Cheesecake, Jello Shot and Soap, Heart, 8-Cavity","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41T8KZsKvZL._AC_.jpg","description":"Create your own special desserts or homemade soaps with the Freshware SL-124RD 8-Cavity Silicone Heart Muffin, Cupcake, Brownie, Cornbread, Cheesecake, Panna Cotta, Pudding, Jello Shot and Soap Mold. This mold is constructed with 100% pure, professional quality food-grade silicone, which meets US FDA and European LFGB safety standards (BPA, PVC and Phthalate FREE). Simply pour your favorite recipe in the mold, prepare, and cool completely. Then turn it upside down, this flexible silicone mold offers a non-stick surface that allows the baked goods to pop right out with a little push from the bottom. Remember to place the silicone mold on a baking sheet for easier positioning and removal. Mold Size: 11.7 x 6.8 x 1.4 inch. Cavity Size: 2.5 x 2.3 x 1.4 inch. Volume: 8 x 2.6 oz, Total 20.8 oz. Many customers have found creative ways to use Freshware silicone molds (depending upon the shape) to create delicious homemade cupcakes, muffins, brownies, cookies, cheesecakes, quiches, breads, chocolates, candies, tarts, butters, caramels, ice cubes, frozen baby foods, gelatin, ice creams etc. Other customers use the molds in unique ways to create clays, resin casting, candles, soaps and more. All Freshware silicone products DO NOT have Chemical Coatings and are Pinch Test Passed. Our silicone mold handles temperature from -40 to +446 degrees Fahrenheit (-40 to +230 degrees Celsius). Reusable for up to 3,000 uses, our molds save money by eliminating the need to ever buy disposable paper liners again. Safe to use in the Oven, Refrigerator, Freezer, Microwave, Steamer and Dishwasher. Top rack dishwasher safe, but hand washing is recommended to extend the life of the product. What Is A Pinch Test? Cheaper brands often use plastic fillers in their silicone products, so it is not safe for high-temperature baking. Pinch and twist a bit of the silicone, if it turns white, it’s got fillers as 100% pure silicone will retain its color.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41T8KZsKvZL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Freshware","source_asin":"B004MCZO80","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-798814","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004MCZO80","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004MCZO80","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
