window.products.push({"id":798847,"name":"Labeol 4th of July Tablecloth, 3 PCS American Flag 54 x 108 Inch Disposable Plastic Tablecloth, 4th of July Decorations Table Cover Party Supplies for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816OUxhdQML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎁【Package Includes】The 4th of July tablecloth include 3 American flag tablecloth, This table cover with stripes and stars as the theme elements and the red, white and blue colors. Perfectly in line with the atmosphere of Forth of July, Patriotic, Memorial, Independence, Veterans Day, Columbus Day. Adding different colors to your party. 📐【Large Size】All 4th of July tablecloths dimensions are 54 x 108 inch, enough to fit a variety of rectangular tables. It's not just a tablecloth, it's more like a decoration. Adding vibrant colors to your table, hope you will have a memorable Independence Day party. ✅【Durable Material & Easy to Clean】Labeol American flag tablecloth are made of PE materials, eco-friendly ink, safe, non-toxic, durable, waterproof and oil resistant. Of course, although the tablecloth is disposable, but if you want to reuse it, you can clean it with a cloth or paper towel with a little water, it is easy to clean. 🌈【Delicate Design】The design of this tablecloth is inspired by the American flag, red, white and blue are printed brightly, red symbolizes courage, white symbolizes purity and blue symbolizes perseverance.Stars and stripes are the main elements of the tablecloth, displays the America sprit, adding to the festive atmosphere. 🥂【Application Scenarios】This can be used for 4th of July, Patriotic party, Memorial, Independence Day, Veterans Day, Columbus Day, decorations. For example,the background when taking photos,as wallpaper it is also a good choice.It is a tablecloth, but also a good decoration. It's suitable for various homes, restaurants, kitchens, picnics and various party events. 💯【100% Satisfaction】Before using the product, please check for damaged. If there is any quality problem with the product, please feel free to contact us for exchange service. We will do our best to provide you with the best service!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816OUxhdQML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Labeol","source_asin":"B0C6XN5C4M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-798847","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6XN5C4M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6XN5C4M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":798848,"name":"PHILIPS 4300 Series Fully Automatic Espresso Machine - LatteGo Milk Frother, 8 Coffee Varieties, Intuitive Touch Display, Black, (EP4347/94)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":999.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81c0Otf5N1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Philips 4300 fully automatic espresso machine with LatteGo brings café-quality coffee to the home, offering up to 8 different coffee drinks with just the touch of a button via its new user interface. Managing the entire process from bean to brew seamlessly, the machine is designed with durable, ceramic grinders and features the easy-to-clean LatteGo milk frothing system and the Aroma Extract brewing system. Top your coffee off with a silky-smooth layer of milk froth. The LatteGo mixes milk and air at high speed in the round frothing chamber, then adds a splash-free, creamy layer of milk froth to your cup at just the right temperature. Our 2 part milk system has no tubes or hidden parts and can be cleaned in as little as 15 seconds under the tap or in the dishwasher. The TFT display with icons will make the preparation of aromatic coffee from freshly ground beans extremely easy and intuitive. Enjoy coffee you love the same way every time with two user profiles that store your customized recipes. With an extra guest profile, your visitors can savor a coffee exactly the way they like, without changing yours. The Aroma Extract system intelligently strikes the optimum balance between brewing temperature and aroma extraction by keeping the water temperature between 90 and 98°C, while regulating the water flow rate, so you can enjoy delicious coffees. Our durable ceramic grinders can be adjusted in 12 steps, so you can turn your beans into anything from ultra-fine powder to coarse grindings. Our grinders are 100% pure ceramic: extremely hard and precise, so you can enjoy fresh aromatic coffee, for at least 20.000 cups. Our patented innovation, AquaClean water filter, ensures you make the most out of your fully automatic coffee machine. By changing the filter at machine request, you will not need to descale your machine for up to 5000* cups, while enjoying clear and purified water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81c0Otf5N1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Philips Kitchen Appliances","source_asin":"B09HJ6V43W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-798848","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HJ6V43W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HJ6V43W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
