window.products.push({"id":798971,"name":"Japanese Cast Iron Teapot Large Capacity 40Oz with Trivet and Loose Leaf Tea Infuser, Cast Iron Tea Kettle Stovetop Safe. Tetsubin Coated with Enamel ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fRS39SRsL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"HANDMADE KIYOSHI - Perhaps it’s the unique shapes, prints, and 2-Tone Colors we use for our teapots that makes them the preferred teapot for things like Corporate, Anniversaries, Weddings, or Engagement Gifts. Or maybe it’s because we treat tradition with esteem. Either way, Kiyoshi Luxury is only for those who “know” and honor special tea. BLACK & GOLD - This Kiyoshi Luxury Teapot comes in 4 different colors, each one individually molded, and hand-painted in a labor-intensive two color process. It produces the most stunning finish you’ve seen on any similar pot. They’re not a cheap teapot, which is great news for anyone frustrated with mass-produced clones. WHAT'S INCLUDED? Contains one solid cast iron teapot weighing 3.7lbs that holds 40oz of your best quality Japanese Green Tea or brew of choice. This beautiful and unique teapot comes with its matching trivet and stainless steel tea infuser. Rust-Proof enamel inside, with a hand painted and glazed exterior, which makes this teapot perfect for tea preparation. BEST USE - We always recommend to heat the water in another vessel and to pour the boiling water into the cast iron teapot after placing the loose tea or tea bags to the infuser – AS A KETTLE, we suggest to not load more than 27Oz (800ml) for boiling. Stovetop safe, the small fire is suggested. – TO CLEAN, rinse the inside with warm water is enough. Always wipe exterior with dry cloth while pot is still warm. FOR LOVERS OF FINE TEA - For those who respect the stillness of ceremony and beautifully handcrafted items, this teapot makes perfect sense. If you are also looking for teacup sets, check out The Kiyoshi Color Trend Tea Cup Collection and choose the color that honors you, or them the most.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fRS39SRsL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KIYOSHI Luxury","source_asin":"B0B86F6HXN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-798971","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B86F6HXN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B86F6HXN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
