window.products.push({"id":798981,"name":"FEEKAA Small Rice Cooker 2 Cup (uncooked), Mini Rice Cooker Small 4 Cup (cooked), 6-in-1 Portable Slow Cooker, Travel Rice Maker, Soup Maker, Stew Pot","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611lq9B5IKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍚[2-CUPS UNCOOKED CAPACITY]: 1.2L small rice cooker 2 cup can cook up to 4 cups of cooked white rice, perfect for 1-3 people. Just the right amount of rice you need and no more leftovers. The compact size (19.5*23*19.6cm) won’t take up too much space, which is very convenient to store or carry. It's suitable for small kitchen, office, dormitory, camping, traveling. Plus, its cute and fashionable appearance will match any kitchen decoration. 🍚[MULTIFUNCTIONAL USE]This electric small rice cooker could suit various dietary preferences, including Rice, Brown Rice, Slow Cook, Soup, Stew and Steam. You can choose from a variety of cooking functions with appropriate time by using the smart control panel. The sweetness and nutrition of the rice can be better released during cooking process, and the cooked rice tastes better and more delicious. 🍚[24-HOUR TIMER PRESET & KEEP WARM FUNCTION]The reservation function allows you to set the time in 10-minute increments for up to 24 hours. Select the time and confirm the reservation to ensure that your delicious rice is cooked on time. Once the rice is cooked, the small rice cooker will silently and automatically switch to the keep-warm mode without bothering you. 🍚[CLEAN IS A BREEZE] The non stick inner pot is easy to rinse and is dishwasher safe with superior durability. The detachable steam vent and inner lid make it simple to clean the rice cooker. And the use of extended steam port can effectively control the overflow of the rice cooker, making it safer to use. 🍚[MULTIPLE ACCESSORIES&12 MONTHS WARRANTY] The 200w small rice cooker includes recipe book,use manual, rice spatula, measuring cup, removable pot with nonstick coating.And we offer a 30-day free replacement policy and 12-month guarantee for FEEKAA rice cooker. Any quality issues we provide refund, replacement or technical assistance.Your satisfaction is our top priority.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611lq9B5IKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"feekaa","source_asin":"B0BNNGNLBT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-798981","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNNGNLBT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNNGNLBT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
